### Register A User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "a@a.co",
    "password": "12345678"
}


### Login A User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "a@a.co",
    "password": "12345678"
}


